" and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/MEGA_Servers","title":"MEGA Servers"},"children":["MEGA Servers"]},". The location of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevators"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Leaderboard","title":"Leaderboard"},"children":["Leaderboards"]}," changed between the versions. Next to it is a green building, which lead to either an underground section with more ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevators"]},", or to an upstairs spot which at one point contained ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/PVP","title":"PVP"},"children":["PVP"]}," ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevators"]},". Last notable side would have contained the teleport to the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hardcore_Lobby","title":"Hardcore Lobby"},"children":["Hardcore Lobby"]},". A few other spots existed, located somewhere around the four main areas, which include various statues or a pathway to the clothing area, which contained ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Clothing","title":"Clothing"},"children":["Clothing"]}," made by Tower Defense Simulator clothing designers."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The second notable ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Unused Overhaul Lobby"]}," is a Halloween themed version of the previous lobby. The lobby would be set during night with multiple pumpkins, a statue of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dark_Necromancer","title":"Dark Necromancer"},"children":["Dark Necromancer"]},", webs with spiders on them and a giant ghost ship."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwcQ"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Gallery_2"},"children":["Gallery"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwcg"},"children":["\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Main Lobby"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"c